                <mxCell id="t6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" value="&lt;b&gt;ARCH_5&lt;/b&gt; — Build 5 (M0.5): it runs. The Dockerfile, deploy/compose.yaml, internal/api health endpoints and scripts/smoke.sh land; &lt;b&gt;serve&lt;/b&gt; now serves for real and &lt;b&gt;runner&lt;/b&gt; idles until the M1.3 link. First build with runtime code, first build CI smoke-tests end to end." vertex="1">
