                <mxCell id="t8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" value="&lt;b&gt;ARCH_7&lt;/b&gt; — Build 7 (M1.2): it has a face. web/ (React 18 · TypeScript strict · Vite · Tailwind v4) lands with the theme system and app shell, internal/web embeds the build, and sign-in returns 204 to fetch instead of 303. First build with a browser UI, first build with screenshot baselines." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="60" width="1090" x="40" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
